Package: network-manager-tailscale
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, network-manager, tailscale
Suggests: network-manager-tailscale-gnome, network-manager-tailscale-plasma
Description: NetworkManager VPN plugin for Tailscale
 Connects and disconnects Tailscale through NetworkManager, using the
 tailscaled LocalAPI. This package has the VPN service and the
 NetworkManager plugin, enough for nmcli and the network applets.

Package: network-manager-tailscale-gnome
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, network-manager-tailscale (= ${binary:Version})
Description: NetworkManager VPN plugin for Tailscale (GTK editors)
 Connection editor for GNOME Settings (GTK4) and nm-connection-editor
 (GTK3).

Package: network-manager-tailscale-plasma
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, network-manager-tailscale (= ${binary:Version}),
         plasma-nm (>= ${plasmanm:Version}), plasma-nm (<< ${plasmanm:Version}.1~)
Description: NetworkManager VPN plugin for Tailscale (Plasma editor)
 Connection editor for KDE Plasma. Built against the private headers of
 one plasma-nm version, so it has to be rebuilt when plasma-nm changes.
